<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111805" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλογ-μός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flame, blaze,</i> as of
			lightning, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρὸς φ. ὁ Διός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					831
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				1019
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hec.</u>
				474
			</span></i> (lyr.), f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1162
			</span></i> (lyr.); <i>fiery heat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				940
			</span></i> (lyr.); of <i>burning lava,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				400b4
			</span></i>: of the funeral pyre, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				4.719
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Bithynia</span>); pl., <i><span class="en">
				Eratosth.
			</span></i> ap. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.468
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>fire,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.118
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>inflammation,</i> Hipp.<i><span class="en">
				<u>VM</u>
				19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>VC</u>
				15
			</span></i>, al.; <i>feverish heat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Peregr.</u>
				44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>heat of passion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.166
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				238
			</span></i>.</div>
